\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces RAVEN-MCS workflow. (a)~Opportunity/observation correction supplies normalized local weights and reference mass; raw records remain local. (b)~Pre-$U$ correction forms $\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle \boldsymbol  \beta $}\mathaccent "0362{\boldsymbol  \beta }_r$; calibration produces feasible $\boldsymbol  \alpha _r^\star $ from current support, composition, target, and state. Exact target matching need not be feasible. (c)~Weighted updates are aggregated before debt/history updates. Solid/dashed arrows denote current-window flow/next-window feedback. Carriers and vectors are schematic.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:raven_overview}{{1}{3}{RAVEN-MCS workflow. (a)~Opportunity/observation correction supplies normalized local weights and reference mass; raw records remain local. (b)~Pre-$U$ correction forms $\widehat {\boldsymbol \beta }_r$; calibration produces feasible $\boldsymbol \alpha _r^\star $ from current support, composition, target, and state. Exact target matching need not be feasible. (c)~Weighted updates are aggregated before debt/history updates. Solid/dashed arrows denote current-window flow/next-window feedback. Carriers and vectors are schematic}{figure.1}{}}
